#
# Accepted CVEs for the Trivy image gate (.github/workflows/images.yml).
# Only CVEs that are (a) bundled in a third-party base/runtime we cannot patch without a major
# upgrade AND (b) not reachable with attacker-controlled input in our deployment belong here.
# Each entry must carry a justification and an expiry so it is revisited.

# --- Apache Spark bundled JARs (services/spark_jobs/*) ---
# None accepted. The images patch the distribution's jars/ at build (services/spark_jobs/
# patch-spark-jars.sh): netty is replaced as a set with a fixed release, and Derby and the Spark
# Connect REPL jars are removed (unused). The OS layer is patched by `apt-get upgrade`, kept from going
# stale by SECURITY_REFRESH in .github/workflows/images.yml.
